      "details": "<p>Richard Talbert discusses the naming and labeling of roads in and around the city of Rome as part of the place record for the city of Rome herself. He notes that the label \"Via Lavicana\" appears in conjunction with the place name\u00a0<em>Adqvintanas</em>.</p>",
